title They kick it over the sideline
intro Red has the ball near the side.
flip vertical

setup
  lineup 7v7
  player R-LF at 50.4, 53.0
  ball with R-LF

step
  caption Red has the ball near the sideline.

step
  caption Red kicks it — all the way over the sideline!
  ball to 44.1, 73.4
  arrow from R-LF to ball
  draw sideline bottom
  duration 1450

question
  prompt What restart is it?
  answer Throw-in
  wrong Goal kick
  wrong Corner
  wrong Kick-off
  why Over the sideline, the other team throws it back in.

step
  caption Blue is ready to throw it back in.
  B-RB to 44.1, 66.6
  ball with B-RB
  label B-RB Throw
  draw sideline bottom

step
  caption Blue throws it back onto the field.
  ball to 50.4, 55.8
  arrow from B-RB to ball
